    "title": "Understanding prompt engineering may not require rethinking generalization",
    "citation": "Victor Akinwande et al., 2023",
    "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.03957",
    "authors": "Victor Akinwande; Yi-Ding Jiang; Dylan Sam; J. Kolter",
