    "problems": "The CLIP image encoder's training data is not publicly disclosed, so possible contamination of evaluation datasets is difficult to verify. Several reported trends are figure-only in the supplied text and lack numerical values. The results concern prompt search on pretrained models and do not directly test the listed network-training claim versions.",
    "rows_left_out": "No results omitted from Table 2 within the 60-row limit. Figure-only results for random-label proportions, prompt length, small-data search, regularized search, and vocabulary pruning are not represented as numeric rows because the text does not give assignable values for those plotted points.",
